            "sid": "LEV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Uma umuntu eletha umnikelo wempuphu kuJehova, umnikelo wakhe uyakuba yimpuphu ecolekileyo; kumelwe athele amafutha phezu kwawo futhi abeke impepho phezu kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelwe uwulethe emadodaneni ka-Aroni, abapristi; athabathe isandla sakhe kufulawa wakhe nasemafutheni akhe kanye nayo yonke impepho ekuyo; umpristi ashise isikhumbuzo sawo e-altare njengomnikelo womlilo wephunga elimnandi kuJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuseleyo komnikelo womlilo kuyakuba ngokuka-Aroni namadodana akhe; kuyingcwelengcwele yeminikelo yomlilo kaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma uletha umnikelo womlilo ophekwe eziko, woba amaqebelengwane angenamvubelo empuphu ecolekileyo exovwe namafutha, noma amaqebelengwane angenamvubelo, agcotshwe ngamafutha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma umnikelo wakho wokudla kungumnikelo wokudla obhakwe epanini, kumelwe ube ngokafulawa ocolekileyo ongenamvubelo oxutywe namafutha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelwe uwuhlukanise ube yizicucu, uthele amafutha kuzo; kungumnikelo womlilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
